{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/842926-when-demon-pc-s-are-fighting-angels-in-cover","id":842926,"title":"When Demon PC's are fighting angels in cover?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-06T01:53:24-08:00","id":842926,"title":"When Demon PC's are fighting angels in cover?","content":"How are they not always breaking compromise if they are using embeds or exploits, what if they use a partial or full transformation and make the cover role, does the angel just not get a lock on their demon signal underneath the cover ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7078-nyxsis","name":"Nyxsis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-06T02:02:03-08:00","id":842928,"title":"","content":"It's much easier to trigger Compromise in the presence of an Angel, there are rules for it somewhere in the book, but generally Angels seem to be more something to avoid than something to fight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4968-mrbreaksit","name":"MrBreaksIt","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-06T19:35:49-08:00","id":843255,"title":"","content":"Well first assuming full demonic form even without an angel present is an immediate compromise check at -3. Amusingly a partial transformation has a compromise bonus depending on how many of your demonic powers you aren't using.<br /> <br /> As Breaksit says the general penalty to a compromise when in the presence of an angel is -X where the X is the angel's rank. I would say with partial you can generally go with the standard rule with the idea being that the angel might not notice some of the more subtle demonic form aspects. Of course in the case of Exampiel deciding to use partial or full transformation then the ST is fully within their rights to say that Exampiel now has the blown condition because well the freaking angel is right there and can bloody see the demon.<br /> <br /> Now exploits are somewhat alien to angels they understand the principals behind but they don't use exploits. Essentially your best case here is the standard compromise -rank check. If you get a success it either meaning the angel isn't processing what's going on properly and is thus having a problem locking onto the demon through cover; or that the angel is aware of a demon's presence, but is unable to perfectly establish which its coming from. More than likely you'll get the hunted condition since the angel is aware you're a demon they just haven't managed to get a sufficient lock on you to bypass your covers. <br /> <br /> Embeds are subtle they use the same systems an angel does for its trick, but an angel isn't thinking about using an embed when it does most of the time. If a situation comes up where an angel is directly effected or targeted by an embed or present when a more extreme one is used in the vicinity then just go with the compromise check to see if the angel is aware of the embed being used.<br /> <br /> Of course all of this I put the caveat that at any time your ST is probably within their rights to decide that you are throwing too much heat at the angel and that you've either gained the hunted or blown condition regardless of your cover.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}